g electricity bills with home batteries</h4></a></div></li><li class="recommended-item"><div class="thumbnail"><a href="https://www.foxbusiness.com/video/6403012979112" data-omtr-intcmp="fbn_recommended_videos_item_click_20"><picture class="item-thumbnail"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/920f46f2-d73e-4837-bf8a-89d9833bebac/0b189314-7f2c-4ae5-b799-02770dee5370/1280x720/match/200/113/image.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/920f46f2-d73e-4837-bf8a-89d9833bebac/0b189314-7f2c-4ae5-b799-02770dee5370/1280x720/match/400/226/image.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"><source media="(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1919px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/920f46f2-d73e-4837-bf8a-89d9833bebac/0b189314-7f2c-4ae5-b799-02770dee5370/1280x720/match/240/135/image.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/920f46f2-d73e-4837-bf8a-89d9833bebac/0b189314-7f2c-4ae5-b799-02770dee5370/1280x720/match/480/270/image.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"><source media="(min-width: 1920px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/920f46f2-d73e-4837-bf8a-89d9833bebac/0b189314-7f2c-4ae5-b799-02770dee5370/1280x720/match/320/180/image.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/920f46f2-d73e-4837-bf8a-89d9833bebac/0b189314-7f2c-4ae5-b799-02770dee5370/1280x720/match/640/360/image.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <img src="https://a57.foxnews.com/cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/920f46f2-d73e-4837-bf8a-89d9833bebac/0b189314-7f2c-4ae5-b799-02770dee5370/1280x720/match/320/180/image.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" alt="Investor argues artificial intelligence is the ‘new oil’" class="m"></picture></a></div> <div class="content"><a href="https://www.foxbusiness.com/video/6403012979112" data-omtr-intcmp="fbn_recommended_videos_item_click_20"><h4 class="title">Investor argues artificial intelligence is the ‘new oil’</h4></a></div></li></ul> <button role="button" aria-label="Scroll right" tabindex="0" aria-controls="scrollable-list" class="right btn btn-next">Right Arrow</button></div></section></div> <div class="page-content"><main class="main-content"><article section="technology" tags="[object Object],[object Object],[object Object]" class="article-wrap"><!----> <header class="article-header"><div class="article-meta article-meta-upper"><div class="eyebrow"><a href="/category/business-tech">Business Tech</a></div> <div class="article-date"><span class="article-date__published"><span class="article-date__label--published"><strong>Published</strong></span> <time class="article-date__time article-date__time--published">
          October 15, 2025 7:16pm EDT
        </time></span> <!----> <!----></div></div> <h1 class="headline">Chinese company launches autonomous flying taxi with 100-mile range</h1> <h2 class="sub-headline">EHang's VT35 aircraft debuts in Hefei with 100+ mile range and vertical takeoff capabilities</h2> <!----> <div class="article-meta article-meta-lower"><div class="social-byline"><div class="article-social "><div class="social-icons"><ul><li title="Share on Facebook" class="fb"><a href="#">Facebook</a></li> <li title="Share on X" class="tw"><a href="#">Twitter</a></li> <li title="Share on Threads" class="threads"><a href="#" data-omtr-intcmp="fbn_technology_article_main-content_article-meta_3_threads">Threads</a></li> <!----> <li title="Print this Page" class="print"><a href="#">Print</a></li> <li title="Share via Email" class="email"><a href="#">Email</a></li> <li title="Add Fox Business on Google" class="googlePreferred"><a href="#" data-omtr-intcmp="fbn_technology_article_main-content_article-meta_7_add_fox_business_on_google" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Add Fox Business on Google</a></li></ul></div></div> <div class="author-byline"><span><div class="author-headshot"><div class="m"><img src="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2022/10/340/340/Louis-Casiano.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" alt="Louis Casiano"></div></div> <span class="article-authors"><span>By </span> <span class="authors"><span class="author"><a href="https://www.foxbusiness.com/person/c/louis-casiano" rel="author">Louis Casiano</a> <span></span></span></span></span> <span class="article-source"><a href="https://www.foxbusiness.com/">FOXBusiness</a></span></span></div></div> <!----></div></header> <div class="article-content-wrap sticky-columns"><div class="article-content"><div class="article-body"><!----> <!----> <div class="featured featured-video video-ct"><div class="contain"><div class="control"><a href="#" aria-label="top" class="top"></a> <a href="#" class="close">close</a></div> <div class="video-container"><div data-video-id="6375672355112" data-video-domain="foxbusiness" class="m video-player"><a href="https://www.foxbusiness.com/video/6375672355112"><picture><source srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/a848040e-ea2d-4287-808d-731d3e604c2b/f31fabba-7838-4a26-a5fc-bf9389dcfe19/1280x720/match/288/162/image.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" media="(max-width: 767px)"> <source srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/a848040e-ea2d-4287-808d-731d3e604c2b/f31fabba-7838-4a26-a5fc-bf9389dcfe19/1280x720/match/672/378/image.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" media="(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1023px)"> <source srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/a848040e-ea2d-4287-808d-731d3e604c2b/f31fabba-7838-4a26-a5fc-bf9389dcfe19/1280x720/match/767/450/image.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" media="(min-width: 1024px) and (max-width: 1279px)"> <source srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/a848040e-ea2d-4287-808d-731d3e604c2b/f31fabba-7838-4a26-a5fc-bf9389dcfe19/1280x720/match/896/504/image.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" media="(min-width: 1280px)"> <img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/854081161001/a848040e-ea2d-4287-808d-731d3e604c2b/f31fabba-7838-4a26-a5fc-bf9389dcfe19/1280x720/match/image.jpg" alt="Rep. John Moolenaar, R-Mich., discusses the security concerns over the infiltration of Chinese nationals from the border, the use of Chinese drones as well as companies trading on U.S. exchanges on 'Mornings with Maria.'" width="896" height="500"></picture> <span class="overlay">video</span></a></div></div> <div class="info"><div class="caption"><h2 class="title"><a href="https://www.foxbusiness.com/video/6375672355112">US needs to 'work' its way out of dependence on Chinese drones, GOP rep says</a></h2> <p>Rep. John Moolenaar, R-Mich., discusses the security concerns over the infiltration of Chinese nationals from the border, the use of Chinese drones as well as companies trading on U.S. exchanges on 'Mornings with Maria.'</p></div></div></div></div> <p>A <a href="https://www.foxbusiness.com/category/fox-news-drones" target="_blank" rel="noopener">pilotless taxi</a> developed in China that can fly more than 100 miles on a single charge launched this week.</p> <div class="ad-container mobile ad-h-250 ad-w-300 ad-placeholder-load"><div data-iu="ban1" id="mobile-mw-ad-ban1" class="ad gam inline"></div></div><p>EHang Holdings introduced the VT35 on Monday in <a href="https://www.foxbusiness.com/category/china" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hefei, Anhui Province</a>. The taxi is part of EHang&#x2019;s line of long-range, pilotless electric vertical takeoff and landing (eVTOL) aircraft.</p><p>&quot;It [the car] is engineered to transform intercity aerial travel into a safe, routine, and efficient transportation experience,&quot; the company said in a news release.</p> <p><a href="https://www.foxnews.com/opinion/my-chinese-drone-ban-big-win-us-national-security-ccp-tech-poses-major-threats" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong><u>MY CHINESE DRONE BAN IS A BIG WIN FOR US NATIONAL SECURITY BUT CCP TECH STILL POSES MAJOR THREATS</u></strong></a></p><div class="ad-container mobile ad-h-250 ad-w-300 ad-placeholder-load"><div data-iu="ban2" id="mobile-mw-ad-ban2" class="ad gam inline"></div></div> <div class="inline image-ct"><div class="m"><picture><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/343/192/china-pilotless-taxi-drone.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/686/384/china-pilotless-taxi-drone.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <source media="(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1023px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/672/378/china-pilotless-taxi-drone.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/1344/756/china-pilotless-taxi-drone.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <source media="(min-width: 1024px) and (max-width: 1279px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/931/523/china-pilotless-taxi-drone.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/1862/1046/china-pilotless-taxi-drone.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <source media="(min-width: 1280px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/720/405/china-pilotless-taxi-drone.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/1440/810/china-pilotless-taxi-drone.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <img src="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/931/523/china-pilotless-taxi-drone.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" alt="The VT35 aircraft"></picture></div> <div class="caption"><p><span>The VT35 can fly more than 100 miles on a single charge, EHang said. </span><span> (EHang / Fox News)</span></p></div></div><p>The two-seat <a href="https://www.foxbusiness.com/category/fox-news-air-and-space" target="_blank" rel="noopener">flying vehicle</a> features autonomous flight systems, electric propulsion, and a compact airframe designed to make urban aerial travel safer and more efficient, the <a href="https://nypost.com/2025/10/15/tech/driverless-flying-taxis-can-fly-nearly-125-miles-on-one-battery-charge/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York Post</a> reported.</p><div data-unit-credible=",," data-in-article="true" class="credible"></div><p>In addition, it features eight distributed lift propellers for vertical takeoff and landing, meaning it can land on rooftops, parking lots, and other structures.</p><p><a href="https://www.foxbusiness.com/markets/dronemaker-dji-sues-pentagon-over-chinese-military-listing-alleges-significant-financial-harm" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>DRONEMAKER DJI SUES PENTAGON OVER CHINESE MILITARY LISTING, ALLEGES SIGNIFICANT FINANCIAL HARM</strong></a></p><div class="ad-container mobile ad-h-250 ad-w-300 ad-placeholder-load"><div data-iu="ban3" id="mobile-mw-ad-ban3" class="ad gam inline"></div></div><div class="inline image-ct"><div class="m"><picture><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/343/192/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-002.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/686/384/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-002.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <source media="(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1023px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/672/378/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-002.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/1344/756/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-002.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <source media="(min-width: 1024px) and (max-width: 1279px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/931/523/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-002.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/1862/1046/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-002.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <source media="(min-width: 1280px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/720/405/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-002.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/1440/810/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-002.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <img src="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/931/523/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-002.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" alt="EHang's VT35 "></picture></div> <div class="caption"><p><span>EHang's VT35 was unveiled this week in China.</span><span> (EHang / Fox News)</span></p></div></div><p>The two-seat aircraft also has a leather-upholstered cabin equipped with a touchscreen interface that serves as both a dashboard and entertainment hub, Interesting Engineering reported.</p><p>&quot;As a pioneer in pilotless eVTOL technology, EHang is continuously optimizing aircraft performance and expanding applications to offer the public safer, smarter, and more accessible low-altitude transportation solutions for a greener, shared future in global civil aviation,&quot; said EHang founder and CEO Huazhi Hu.</p><div class="inline image-ct"><div class="m"><picture><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/343/192/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-003.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/686/384/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-003.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <source media="(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1023px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/672/378/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-003.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/1344/756/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-003.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <source media="(min-width: 1024px) and (max-width: 1279px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/931/523/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-003.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/1862/1046/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-003.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <source media="(min-width: 1280px)" srcset="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/720/405/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-003.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1, https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/1440/810/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-003.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1 2x"> <img src="https://a57.foxnews.com/static.foxbusiness.com/foxbusiness.com/content/uploads/2025/10/931/523/china-pilotless-taxi-drone-003.jpg?ve=1&amp;tl=1" alt="EHang's VT35 seen flying in the sky"></picture></div> <div class="caption"><p><span>VT35 Long-Range Pilotless Human-Carrying Aerial Vehicle</span><span> (EHang / Fox News)</span></p></div></div><p><a href="https://www.foxbusiness.com/apps-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong><u>GET FOX BUSINESS ON THE GO BY CLICKING HERE</u></strong></a></p><div class="ad-container mobile ad-h-250 ad-w-300 ad-placeholder-load"><div data-iu="ban4" id="mobile-mw-ad-ban4" class="ad gam inline"></div></div><p>No date was given for the aircraft&apos;s global release. However, it reportedly will set buyers back around $913,000.</p></div> <footer class="article-footer"><!----> <!----> <div class="partners"><div class="partner geo-item"><div data-uid="fbr-ar-21" class="vendor-unit "></div></div> <div class="partner geo-item"><div data-uid="fbr-ar-22" class="vendor-unit "></div></div> <div class="partner geo-item"><div data-uid="fbr-ar-23" class="vendor-unit "></div></div> <div class="partner geo-item"><div data-uid="ar-19" class="vendor-unit tablet-desktop"></div></div> <div class="partner geo-item"><div data-uid="MB_2" class="vendor-unit mobile"></div></div></div></footer></div> <aside aria-label="primary sidebar" class="sidebar sidebar-primary"><div class="sticky-region"><section class="collection collection-market-indexes"><header class="heading"><h2 class="title">U.S. Stock Market Quotes</h2></header> <p class="cls-fill-up dek"></p> <div class="content"><form autocomplete="off" action="/search" method="get"><fieldset><div class="input-wrap quote-lookup"><input value type="text" placeholder="Quote Lookup" name="q" onblur onfocus autocomplete="off" aria-label="quote lookup" class="input-text"> <input type="hidden" na